    "title": "KangLiao/DL3DV-Depth-DA3-Aligned · Datasets at Hugging Face",
    "status": 200,
    "markdown": "![Hugging Face's logo](https://huggingface.co/front/assets/huggingface_logo-noborder.svg) Hugging Face⟨1⟩\n  *  Models ⟨2⟩\n  *  Datasets ⟨3⟩\n  *  Spaces ⟨4⟩\n  *  Buckets new⟨5⟩\n  *  Docs ⟨6⟩\n  *  Enterprise ⟨7⟩\n  * Pricing⟨8⟩\n  *     * Website\n      *  Tasks⟨9⟩\n      *  HuggingChat⟨10⟩\n      *  Collections⟨11⟩\n      *  Languages⟨12⟩\n      *  Organizations⟨13⟩\n    * Community\n      *  Blog⟨14⟩\n      *  Posts⟨15⟩\n      *  Daily Papers⟨16⟩\n      *  Hardware⟨17⟩\n      *  Learn⟨18⟩\n      *  Discord⟨19⟩\n      *  Forum⟨20⟩\n      *  GitHub⟨21⟩\n    * Solutions\n      *  Team & Enterprise⟨7⟩\n      *  Hugging Face PRO⟨22⟩\n      *  Enterprise Support⟨23⟩\n      *  Inference Providers⟨24⟩\n      *  Inference Endpoints⟨25⟩\n      *  Storage Buckets⟨5⟩\n  * * * *\n  * Log In⟨26⟩\n  * Sign Up⟨27⟩\n\n\n#   Datasets:⟨3⟩\n* * *\n ![](https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/65bc98383b879593a5a2f5e5/p2ZtoTFN6tW-QkcPJf7YT.jpeg) ⟨28⟩\nKangLiao⟨28⟩\n/\nDL3DV-Depth-DA3-Aligned⟨29⟩\nlike 0\nTasks:  Depth Estimation ⟨30⟩\nSize:  1M<n<10M ⟨31⟩\nTags:  depth ⟨32⟩ depth-anything-3 ⟨33⟩ dl3dv ⟨34⟩ metric-depth ⟨35⟩ reconstruction ⟨36⟩ generation ⟨37⟩\nLicense:\napache-2.0\n Dataset card ⟨29⟩ Files Files and versions xet ⟨38⟩ Community ⟨39⟩\nDataset Viewer\nThe dataset viewer is not available because its heuristics could not detect any supported data files⟨40⟩. You can try uploading⟨41⟩ some data files, or configuring⟨42⟩ the data files location manually.\n  * Sample Videos⟨43⟩\n  * Directory structure⟨44⟩\n  * How the depth was produced⟨45⟩\n  * Usage⟨46⟩\n  * Notes⟨47⟩\n  * Caption Pipeline⟨48⟩\n\n\n#   ⟨49⟩ DL3DV-Depth-DA3-Aligned \nPer-frame depth annotations for the DL3DV dataset, produced by **Depth-Anything-3 (DA3)** and then **aligned** to each scene's sparse depth from the original DL3DV reconstruction. We use this refined dataset for 3D world generation and reconstruction in our **Puffin-World**⟨50⟩.\n##   ⟨43⟩ Sample Videos \nEach clip is a 1×3 comparison — **RGB | Original Depth | Our Aligned Depth** — with depth rendered by _vision banana_ representation. It shows how the DA3-aligned depth (right) densifies and cleans up the original sparse depth (middle).  \n|   |   |  \n| --- | --- |  \n|   |   |  \n|   |   |  \n|   |   |  \n|   |   |  \n|   |   |  \n|   |   |  \n|   |   |  \n##   ⟨44⟩ Directory structure \nThe archive mirrors the source DL3DV layout — one `.zip` per scene, grouped into bucket folders `1K`–`7K` (`<bucket>/<scene_hash>.zip`). The scene hashes match DL3DV and DL3DV-Absolute-Camera⟨51⟩, so depth pairs 1:1 with the source frames / absolute camera annotations.\nEach `<scene_hash>.zip` unpacks to:\n\n```\ndense/\n└── depth_da3/\n    ├── frame_00001.npy\n    ├── frame_00002.npy\n    ├── frame_00003.npy\n    └── ...\n\n```\n\nEach `frame_NNNNN.npy` is a float32 depth map — `np.load(...)` returns an array of shape `(H, W)` (e.g. `(536, 954)`), one per source frame, indices matching the DL3DV frames.\n##   ⟨45⟩ How the depth was produced \n  * **Predicted** with Depth-Anything-3 (DA3).\n  * **Aligned** to the sparse depth of the original DL3DV dataset (per-scene alignment against the sparse reconstruction), so each scene's DA3 depth is brought into a consistent, scale-aligned space.\n\n\n##   ⟨46⟩ Usage \n\n```\nimport numpy as np\ndepth = np.load(\"dense/depth_da3/frame_00001.npy\")  # (H, W) float32\n\n```\n\n##   ⟨47⟩ Notes \n  * ~6,377 scenes; each `.npy` frame ≈ 2 MB (float32), stored losslessly.\n  * Companion camera annotations: DL3DV-Absolute-Camera⟨51⟩.\n\n\n##   ⟨48⟩ Caption Pipeline \nBeyond the aligned dataset, we also release **a complete captioning pipeline** for annotating the dense depth map for arbitrary datasets, aligning with the sparse depth, and visualizing the corresponding depth maps. The pipeline is available in our GitHub repository⟨50⟩.\nCopy to bucket new \n\nDownloads last month\n    9,706\nTotal file size: 3.57 TB\nSystem theme\nCompany\nTOS⟨52⟩ Privacy⟨53⟩ About⟨54⟩ Careers⟨55⟩ ⟨1⟩\nWebsite\nModels⟨2⟩ Datasets⟨3⟩ Spaces⟨4⟩ Pricing⟨8⟩ Docs⟨6⟩\n",
